# Wave W17-AB (Route 225): zone floor — the hard road’s worn sand, design-authorised: a hard-trampled tan sand running from Clashfield’s gate to Wildreach, its tread darkened by a thousand training marches, carrying sparse scorch-edge flecks blown off the hardpan (design: the Battle Zone’s hard road — the sand itself is a training surface). Split from Route 224’s head sand by keeping entire (trampled and worn vs swept pale) and from Route 227’s ash-road sand ahead of the program by cover: this sand is bare to the sun, that one falls under ash.
